Multithreading - ability to execute multiple threads within a single process

Threads and processes are managed by time slicing and context switching( process of saving the state of currently running process and loading the state of next one to be executed)

When Java program starts, one threads starts running immediately,which is called main thread. This thread is responsible for executing main thread


How to create thread -
